                        <!-- News-content -->
                        <div class="news-content">

                            <h1>
                                [库存看市场]库存降速放缓，钢价低位运行</h1>
                            <span class="time">
                                2026年10月24日06:59
                                来源：西本资讯</span>

                            <div class="summary">
                                <p>摘要：期螺不强，现货偏弱；区间起伏，重心调低。这是本周市场的主要特色。接下来，预计终端需求平淡，投机需求退缩，期货低位波动，现货窄幅调整。</p>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="news-content-text">
                            <p><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">本周（</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">19</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">日—</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">23</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">日），西本资讯监测的数据显示，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">截至</span><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">23</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">日，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">全国69个主要市场25mm规格三级螺纹钢平均价格为3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">420</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">元/吨，周环比</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">下跌9</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">元；高线HPB300φ6.5mm平均价格为3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">590</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">元/吨，周环比</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">下跌7元</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">。</span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本期，全国主要市场建筑钢材</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">价格弱势波动</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">：其中，北方</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">需求减弱</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">有稳有降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；南方</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">期现同步</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">低位起落。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本周西本钢材指数</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">小跌</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，成本指数</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">再降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，显示长流程钢厂利润空间</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">继续改善</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；本周螺纹钢期货主力合约</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">震荡收低</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，对现货</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">有引领作用</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。（下图为红色线条为钢材指数，黄色线条为成本指数）</span></span></p><p><img src="http://pic.steelx2.com/o_1k5jtg1pmccccb1kocfqg16ip9.png" width="854" height="472"/></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">期货方面，本周黑色系主力合约</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">波动收低</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。其中，热卷</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">701</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">合约周五夜盘收在3201元，较上周</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">五</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">收盘</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">3255</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">元下跌54元；螺纹钢</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">701</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">合约周五夜盘收在3042元，较上周</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">五</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">收盘</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">3086</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">元下跌44元；从全周走势情况看，原料端重心下移</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，成材端</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">整体走低</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">回首本期，消息面</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">多空交织</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，铁矿</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">价格下跌</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，螺纹现货趋弱</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，当前行业面</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">有</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">什么变化？后期钢价走势如何？一起看看西本资讯监控到的相关库存数据，再具体分析。</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">一、上海市场分析</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">据西本资讯监测库存数据：截至</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">10</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">22</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">日，沪市螺纹钢库存总量为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">21.15</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，周环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1.90</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降幅为</span><span style="font-family:宋体">8.24</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%（见下图）；目前库存量较上年同期（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">10</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">23</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">日的</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">30.72</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9.57</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">幅为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">31.15</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%。本周沪市螺纹钢库存环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">继续下行</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><img src="http://pic.steelx2.com/o_1k5jtgcbj1ofe1p8d1tbk19bp1fhg9.png" width="843" height="471"/></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本期，西本资讯监测的沪市线螺周终端采购量为</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">.48</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，环比前一</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">周增加</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2.07</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%（见下图）。本周终端需求环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">变化不大，显示刚需总体平缓</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><img src="http://pic.steelx2.com/o_1k5jtgl69a691i9ta6gt51i4m9.png" width="851" height="473"/></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本期西本钢材指数</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">回落</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，市场价格</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">小跌</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">：周一，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">小幅调高</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；周二，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">松动成交</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；周三，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">平盘等待</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；周四</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">盘中下跌</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；周五，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">跌后求稳</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。当下上海市场现状是：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">商家消极进货，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">库存</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">继续减少</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">需求无力放大，价格低位波动</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本周市场价格</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">波动小跌</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，预计下周</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">继续震荡</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">二、库存总结分析</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本期，全国</span><span style="font-family:宋体">35个主要市场样本仓库钢材总库存量为1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">072.30</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，周环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">23.29</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降幅为</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2.13%</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。主要钢材品种中，螺纹钢库存量为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">373.48</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，环</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">比减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">20.51</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">幅为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">5.21</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%；线盘库存量为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">57.99</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，周环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1.15</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降幅为</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1.94</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%；热轧卷板库存量为3</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">71.37</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，周环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3.81</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">幅为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">1.02</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%；中厚板库存量为1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">35.59</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，周环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">增加</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3.22</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">增</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">幅为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">2.43</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%；冷卷板库存量为1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">33.87</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，周环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1.04</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">幅为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">0.77</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">据西本资讯历史数据，当前库存总量较上年同期（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2025年</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">10</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">23</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">日的</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">1108.83</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">减少</span><span style="font-family:宋体">36.53</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">万吨，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">幅为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">3.29</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">%。分品种看，本期五大钢材品种中，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">中厚板库存回升，其它</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">品种库存</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">下降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。（见下图）</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://pic.steelx2.com/o_1k5jtgug9111ms0n1d921bdq1oo29.png" width="846" height="472"/><img src="http://pic.steelx2.com/o_1k5jth5fg8rn1076porqsq53r9.png" width="602" height="147"/></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本周，华东区域建筑钢价格环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">松动</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。截至周五，以各地西本优质品为参照物，华东市场螺纹钢主流基准价格从</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">284</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">0元到3</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">25</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">0元/吨不等，周环比</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">偏弱</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10-20</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span><span style="font-family:宋体">/吨。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本期，影响市场走势的行业资讯主要有（以时间先后排序）：</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">海关总署：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9月中国出口钢铁板材620万吨</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">海关总署数据显示，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2026年9月，中国出口钢铁板材620万吨，同比降3.1%；1-9月累计出口5046万吨，同比降7.4%。9月，中国出口钢铁棒材190万吨，同比增13.5%；1-9月累计出口1576万吨，同比增13.1%。9月，中国出口角钢及型钢74万吨，同比增0.8%；1-9月累计出口597万吨，同比增3.6%。9月，中国出口钢铁线材24万吨，同比降11%；1-9月累计出口208万吨，同比降6.4%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家统计局：前三季度国内生产总值同比增长</span><span style="font-family:宋体">4.6%</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家统计局公布</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2026年前三季度国民经济运行情况，初步核算，前三季度国内生产总值1071071亿元，按不变价格计算，同比增长4.6%。分季度看，一季度国内生产总值同比增长5.0%，二季度增长4.3%，三季度增长4.5%。从环比看，三季度国内生产总值增长1.2%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">中国</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9月今年迄今城镇固定资产投资同比 -7.2%</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">1—9月份，全国固定资产投资（不含农户）334115亿元，同比下降7.2%。其中，知识产权产品投资同比增长9.3%。分产业看，第一产业投资6527亿元，同比下降3.9%；第二产业投资129743亿元，下降2.7%；第三产业投资197845亿元，下降10.0%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">1—9月全国房地产开发投资同比下降20.6%</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家统计局数据显示，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1—9月份，全国房地产开发投资53364亿元，同比下降20.6%；其中，住宅投资41125亿元，下降20.5%。1—9月份，房地产开发企业房屋施工面积565221万平方米，同比下降12.8%。其中，住宅施工面积392558万平方米，下降13.2%。房屋新开工面积34031万平方米，下降24.9%。其中，住宅新开工面积24774万平方米，下降25.4%。房屋竣工面积23271万平方米，下降25.1%。其中，住宅竣工面积16301万平方米，下降26.6%。1—9月份，新建商品房销售面积56483万平方米，同比下降13.2%；其中住宅销售面积下降13.8%。新建商品房销售额53799亿元，下降13.9%；其中住宅销售额下降13.7%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">一二三线城市商品住宅销售价格同比降幅均收窄</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家统计局：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9月份，一线城市新建商品住宅销售价格同比下降0.5%，降幅比上月收窄0.4个百分点。其中，北京、广州和深圳分别下降2.7%、1.1%和1.0%，上海上涨2.8%。二、三线城市新建商品住宅销售价格同比分别下降2.4%和3.9%，降幅分别收窄0.3个和0.2个百分点。9月份，一线城市二手住宅销售价格同比下降1.5%，降幅比上月收窄1.2个百分点。其中，北京、广州和深圳分别下降2.5%、2.9%和1.5%，上海上涨0.8%。二、三线城市二手住宅销售价格同比分别下降4.5%和5.4%，降幅分别收窄0.4个和0.2个百分点。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">1-9月中国粗钢产量72477万吨</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家统计局最新数据显示，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2026年9月中国粗钢产量7359万吨，同比增0.1%；生铁产量6534万吨，同比降1.4%；钢材产量11817万吨，同比降3.8%。1-9月中国累计粗钢产量72477万吨，同比降2.9%；累计生铁产量62844万吨，同比降3%；累计钢材产量106710万吨，同比降2%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家发展改革委：将根据需要及时出台新的增量政策</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">10月20日，国家发展改革委召开10月份新闻发布会。国家发展改革委国民经济综合司副司长左刚表示，国家发展改革委将会同有关部门及时出台实施增量政策，推动存量政策与增量政策协同发力，发挥好宏观政策集成效应，努力实现“十五五”良好开局。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">今年前三季度全国铁路完成固定资产投资</span><span style="font-family:宋体">6012亿元</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">从国铁集团获悉，今年前三季度，全国铁路完成固定资产投资</span><span style="font-family:宋体">6012亿元，同比增长1.3%。前三季度，全国铁路累计投产新线1625公里，京港高铁雄安至商丘段、西渝高铁西安至安康段、宜昌至兴山高铁、哈尔滨至伊春高铁等一批新线、新站开通运营，进一步优化了区域路网布局，提升了运输整体效能，为沿线群众出行提供了便利，有力带动了产业升级和资源开发。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">乘联分会：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10月1-18日全国乘用车市场零售同比下降26%</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">据乘联分会消息，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10月1-18日，全国乘用车市场零售78.9万辆，同比去年10月同期下降26%，较上月同期增长2%，今年以来累计零售1,412.3万辆，同比下降22%；10月1-18日，全国乘用车厂商批发85.3万辆，同比去年10月同期下降20%，较上月同期下降3%，今年以来累计批发2,058.9万辆，同比下降6%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">9月中国钢筋产量1299.3万吨同比降12.6%</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家统计局数据显示，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2026年9月，中国钢筋产量1299.3万吨，同比降12.6%；1-9月累计产量12653.3万吨，同比降12.0%。9月，中国线材（盘条）产量1005.9万吨，同比降12.9%；1-9月累计产量9257.0万吨，同比降8.2%。9月，中国冷轧薄板产量502.2万吨，同比增12.9%；1-9月累计产量3886.2万吨，同比增7.1%。9月，中国中厚宽钢带产量1743.1万吨，同比降4.9%；1-9月累计产量16183.1万吨，同比降4.8%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">中钢协：自律控产降库存是稳运行的关键</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">中钢协：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9月钢材需求不及预期，10月成本支撑减弱，价格震荡偏弱。全球经济展现韧性，国内财政货币政策加码基建，有望阶段性支撑需求。10月上旬粗钢日产环比增长3.1%，重点钢企库存环比增8.4%，社会库存环比增2.7%，供给压力增加。中钢协指出，需求下行压力突出，房地产拖累明显。强调自律控产降库存是稳运行关键，企业应坚持效益优先、以销定产，避免盲目复产和恶性竞争。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">前三季度全国财政收入同比增长</span><span style="font-family:宋体">5.1%</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">财政部</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10月23日发布数据显示，今年前三季度，财政收入平稳增长，全国一般公共预算收入约17.23万亿元，同比增长5.1%，增幅比上半年提高0.4个百分点。其中，前三季度，全国税收收入约14.07万亿元，同比增长6.1%，增幅比上半年提高0.8个百分点。财政支出方面，前三季度，全国一般公共预算支出约21.02万亿元，同比增长1%，投资于人相关支出得到较好保障。（新华社）</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">2026年前三季度全国政府性基金预算收支情况</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">前三季度，全国政府性基金预算收入</span><span style="font-family:宋体">25010亿元，同比下降18.6%。分中央和地方看，中央政府性基金预算收入3682亿元，同比增长12.4%；地方政府性基金预算本级收入21328亿元，同比下降22.3%，其中，国有土地使用权出让收入16087亿元，同比下降27.9%。前三季度，全国政府性基金预算支出62754亿元，同比下降16.2%。分中央和地方看，中央政府性基金预算本级支出3692亿元，同比下降54.4%；地方政府性基金预算支出59062亿元，同比下降11.6%，其中，国有土地使用权出让收入相关支出25565亿元，同比下降18.5%。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">本周，宏观面冷暖交替，与行业相关的主要有：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">前三季财政收入平稳增长，卖地收入降幅较大；</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">国家发改委再次表态，及时出台新的增量政策；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">3</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">、前三季经济成绩单公布，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">GDP增幅强于预期；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">4</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">、固定资产投资增速下降，环比降幅暂停扩张；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">5</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">、房地产行业延续低迷，核心指标尚未企稳；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">6</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">、各线城市房价未能止跌，但同比降幅均有收窄；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">7</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">、铁路固投保持增长，同比增速逐步放缓；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">8</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">、乘用车内销延续颓势，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10月以来降幅还在扩大。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">行业面上，国家统计局数据显示，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9月份我国粗钢产量同比小幅回升，生铁和钢材产量同比下降，同期钢筋和线材产量降幅明显；表明在钢铁产量小幅缩减的同时，建筑钢产量大幅下滑，有效缓解了该品种的供应压力。另据海关数据，9月份我国出口钢铁数量为年内最高水平，其中棒材出口量增幅最大，意味着“外需”的支撑作用还会延续。本周，受资本市场的影响，国内建筑钢市低位调整；展望后期，钢企持续减产的动力不足，而“内需”扩大的可能性很小，预计建筑钢市仍会维持“低位运行，窄幅波动”的走势。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">回首本周，期</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">螺波动收低</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，现货</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">稳中趋弱</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">需求总体平缓</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，商家</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">随行就市</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。从行情走势看，全国各地</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">表现大同小异</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">少数市场维稳，成交不畅；多数区域波动，表现偏弱。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">环比来看，全国市场均价</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">小幅回落</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。总体而言，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">供应平稳</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">库存再降</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">信心不振，低位成交</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">期螺</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">走软</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，现货</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">疲弱</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">区间起伏，小幅调低</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。这是本周市场的主要特色。接下来，预计终端需求</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">平淡</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，投机需求</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">退缩</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，期货</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">低位波动</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，现货</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">窄幅调整</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">对于上海地区而言，市场现状是：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">库存降速放缓，销量回升不畅；预期依然不明，商家出货为主</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">当前的利好因素是：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">天气利于施工，刚需不会消失</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">；利空因素主要有：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">供应未见缩减，期货打压信心</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。本周钢价</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">波动小跌</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">，预计下周</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">低位调整</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 176, 80);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">需要关注的是：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 176, 80);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">原料的涨跌，期货的高低，需求的变化</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 176, 80);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">[文]西本新干线特邀评论员希玛拉亚峰</span></span></p>
                                </div>

                            
                        </div>
